B.b3g=new A.G(B.o,["The image above is exactly what will be shared. Depending on the template it can show the area / province name, the trip date, stop names, counts and your photos. Photo location metadata (EXIF) is not sent, but places, faces and signs visible in a photo stay visible.","Yukar\u0131daki g\xf6rsel payla\u015f\u0131lacak olan\u0131n ayn\u0131s\u0131. Se\xe7ti\u011fin \u015fablona g\xf6re semt / il ad\u0131, gezi tarihi, durak adlar\u0131, say\u0131lar ve ekledi\u011fin foto\u011fraflar g\xf6r\xfcnebilir. Foto\u011fraf dosyalar\u0131n\u0131n konum bilgisi (EXIF) g\xf6nderilmez; ama foto\u011fraf\u0131n i\xe7inde g\xf6r\xfcnen yer, y\xfcz ve tabelalar g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr kal\u0131r."],t.w)
